{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/communities/layout,_N_T_/communities/page,_N_T_/communities"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--oweG6OEEJOkVD2LlWXnjh--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/2a25918c5d8a5b08.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-a187ebefcdbd1c61.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-62902f04efbdd792.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-f10ca8562d68747b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/communities/page-f02b531ff52c168c.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Fox Cities Communities | Lathrop Team</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore the Fox Cities communities served by the Lathrop Team.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"page-transition-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"site\"><header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/lathrop-logo-icon.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">LATHROP TEAM</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main Navigation\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav></header><main class=\"site-main\"><section class=\"page page-communities\"><div class=\"\"><header class=\"section-heading\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fox Cities</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">Neighborhoods at a glance</h2></header></div><div class=\"page-body\"><div class=\"\"><p>From Appleton and Neenah to Menasha, Kaukauna, Kimberly, Little Chute, Greenville, and Oshkosh, the Fox Cities offer a range of options—quiet streets, walkable cores, and everything in between.</p><p>We’ll talk through schools, commute times, resale history, and local amenities so you can choose with confidence.</p></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"community-grid\"><article class=\"community-card\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fox Cities</p><h3 class=\"community-name\">Appleton</h3><p class=\"community-blurb\">A dynamic mix of established neighborhoods and newer developments, with a strong downtown core and easy access to shopping, dining, and schools.</p><span class=\"community-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></article><article class=\"community-card\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fox Cities</p><h3 class=\"community-name\">Neenah</h3><p class=\"community-blurb\">Waterfront charm and established neighborhoods, with convenient access to commuting routes and local amenities.</p><span class=\"community-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></article><article class=\"community-card\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fox Cities</p><h3 class=\"community-name\">Menasha</h3><p class=\"community-blurb\">Historic homes, quiet streets, and proximity to both Appleton and Neenah, offering a balanced pace of life.</p><span class=\"community-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></article><article class=\"community-card\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fox Cities</p><h3 class=\"community-name\">Kaukauna</h3><p class=\"community-blurb\">Growing neighborhoods with a small-town feel and easy access to the Fox River and regional employers.</p><span class=\"community-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></article><article class=\"community-card\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fox Cities</p><h3 class=\"community-name\">Kimberly</h3><p class=\"community-blurb\">Tight-knit community with well-regarded schools and convenient access to Appleton.</p><span class=\"community-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></article><article class=\"community-card\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fox Cities</p><h3 class=\"community-name\">Little Chute</h3><p class=\"community-blurb\">Affordable neighborhoods with a quiet atmosphere and quick access to nearby cities.</p><span class=\"community-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></article><article class=\"community-card\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fox Cities</p><h3 class=\"community-name\">Greenville</h3><p class=\"community-blurb\">Newer developments, larger lots, and a blend of rural feel with modern conveniences.</p><span class=\"community-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></article><article class=\"community-card\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fox Cities</p><h3 class=\"community-name\">Oshkosh</h3><p class=\"community-blurb\">Lakefront access, university-town energy, and a mix of historic and newer housing options.</p><span class=\"community-card-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></article></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><div class=\"site-logo\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/lathrop-logo-icon.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">LATHROP TEAM</span></div><p>Three-generation Fox Cities real estate team with a RealTrends verified record and 525+ five-star reviews.</p></div><div><strong>Contact</strong><p>Diane Lathrop · (920) 428-9227 · diane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Shane Lathrop · (920) 428-0066 · shane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Oliver Lathrop · (920) 858-4424 · oliver@lathropteam.com</p></div><div class=\"footer-kw\"><strong>Keller Williams Fox Cities</strong><p>517 N. Westhill Blvd, Appleton, WI</p><p>Each office is independently owned and operated.</p></div></div></footer></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-a187ebefcdbd1c61.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[245,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"239\\\",\\\"static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[7831,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"239\\\",\\\"static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[1356,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"239\\\",\\\"static/chunks/239-d33310ddfa6356f4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-33cb4717f9edc3d1.js\\\"],\\\"Image\\\"]\\n7:I[5413,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"532\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/communities/page-f02b531ff52c168c.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n12:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/2a25918c5d8a5b08.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\